                                                "example_id": "fb0e6ff9-4797-4f08-96a2-f50145eac515",
                                                "sense_id": "2e8f6fd8-65d4-3a59-88e1-43c317beccaf",
                                                "text": "Then, in a moment of sheer grief, he touched Yebby’s tousled hair for the last time and stood back, watching silently as the men filed away, out of the clearing towards the settlement."
